      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's definitely leaning towards something more sinister. i mean, if it was just bad editing, we'd see it in the digital files, but this looks like a physical, biological lag. it's like the person underneath doesn't quite match the software being projected onto them. honestly, i've been looking into some old footage from before the \"incident\" last year, and the way they carry themselves is completely different. it's like they're a shell. if this were a massive cover-up to replace them with a proxy, how would someone even verify if the real person is still alive or being held somewhere?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
